A15sDsYIdQjiuxc8icks0PVZntmnJhVWUxo5zbMSqUE6n0pEM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNkFYoCvoRzvtqn2Q7i_0no1VaT214koGFIkAAeuA-yog&oe=6AC8F546"}, {"file_name": "library.png", "id": "1086652597211125", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827567_1086652600544458_3297865859665991447_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xLvhRLL-EYwQ7kNvwF9iYa0&_nc_oc=AdokhtW1gtMUMEmGpbHI8XaLzzEjwyGZTNY0F2AVLYFur4vX6q1ae88DGV_fEhMUhBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNhgWAG170fFODUyij51ZZyZ3n1Nxe6d1vRLuiPNmmPoQ&oe=6AC91BC7"}, {"file_name": "episodes.png", "id": "1435532248484102", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1435532255150768_2400528761502540841_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UOfGxSJXP0AQ7kNvwEPrtx-&_nc_oc=AdoWzPgbSGItkyTJ68uMOxHD8v1TS00UqamRUeBIcy1XL85tAII0N5zKhQOnwRmH_Ag&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNoVofMTvEp1zp9joq7clVlEb8zzAavG3RhSzgfYq9ydw&oe=6AC901D0"}, {"file_name": "details.png", "id": "1897347978295960", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1897347981629293_5429150598875932945_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cf4hPdRntuoQ7kNvwH_C8P7&_nc_oc=Adq2i1viMnn5T4iqNhAbDo3YAiarnjvQS1QCy5f85b1U9Rwn0BXMG1Wvl2GuJFtQYiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOjyHaVd7-JrznLzEDtf7CXUPyHAmGUMp6rcJQ3nyAMlQ&oe=6AC90160"}, {"file_name": "screensettings.png", "id": "3663257560506544", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_3663257563839877_1545057611843946175_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SLMACR9Rj3UQ7kNvwEkT1wZ&_nc_oc=Ado06iMla6oPhusykdoh_eoyHyeEe576R0mGYF6JGl_OAQZzfhTClZOtA9UpLQblv6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMsC2W7w2B5ocM4AQWyj7dWU8TfF1KdQMGD5C-5HwyZag&oe=6AC8F5C5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JustScreen", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Your movies. Your screen. Nothing else.\n\nJustScreen is a private, local-first VR media player for Meta Quest. Browse your own movies and TV shows from compatible UPnP/DLNA servers, choose what to watch, make the screen exactly how you like it, and let the controls disappear.\n\n## Make the screen yours\n\nGo from TV-sized to huge and curved. Adjust **size, distance, height and curvature**, recenter instantly, and save your favorite screen profiles.\n\n## One local library\n\nMovies and TV shows from supported local servers appear in one clean library. Browse genres, search your collection, and continue where you left off. Basic UPnP works on its own, while compatible systems such as Kodi can add richer artwork, descriptions, cast, studios and other metadata.\n\n## Watch your way\n\nPlay 2D and compatible side-by-side or top/bottom 3D video. Pause, seek, choose supported audio and subtitle tracks, and select between available versions when needed.\n\n## Private by design\n\n**No account. No ads. No analytics. No tracking. No social features.**\n\nYour library data, playback history, preferences, caches and optional media-server credentials stay on your headset and local network during normal use.\n\n## Bring your own media\n\nJustScreen does not include movies or TV shows. A compatible local UPnP/DLNA server and your own media are required. Internet access is not required for normal playback. Codec support depends on the file, server and headset.", "short_description": "Turn your local movie library into a giant, adjustable VR screen. DLNA playback, rich controls, no social clutter, no distractions.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://valis.dk/projects/justscreen/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "valis.dk", "support_website_url": "https://valis.dk/projects/justscreen/", "website_url": "https://valis.dk/projects/justscreen/", "category"